<title>USA: Gehl Co to expand facilities.</title>
<headline>Gehl Co to expand facilities.</headline>
<dateline>WEST BEND, Wis. 1996-09-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Gehl Co said Thursday it will spend $5.2 million to expand its facilities in Madison, South Dakota, and Yankton, South Dakota.</p>
<p>The construction and agriculture equipment maker said it will add 22,400 square feet to the Madison facility, bringing it to 124,000 square feet, and that it will double the Yankton site by adding 30,400.</p>
<p>--Reuters Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787</p>
</text>
